			<entry>
				
					<id>13900410175</id>
				
					<title>Always can’t open the app</title>
				
					<content type="text">It happens these days, few weeks age, when I open the app, it always hold on the HSBC logo image and then pop out back to my home screen, even I tried refresh the app, reopen my phone, change to different wifi, and then open the app and it still pop out. My IOS suppose can open the app but it always pop out, even I delete and download again, it will still pop out, how can I fix the problem?</content>
				
					<im:contentType term="Application" label="應用程式"/>
				
					<im:voteSum>0</im:voteSum>
				
