			<entry>
				
					<id>13884109733</id>
				
					<title>Stuck when opening app</title>
				
					<content type="text">When I open the app, it always stuck before the login page. Sometimes I need to kill the app more than 10 times then I can arrive the login page. It’s really a bad user experience especially when you are in a hurry to use the mobile cash withdraw or FPS function. Please fix this. Thanks!</content>
				
